60&=\frac{1}{2}(10+10)h \\
30&=5h \\
6&=h
\end{align*}The height is 6, so the length of the top and bottom parallel sides must be 5. The trapezoid is a rectangle with a height of 6 and a length of 5. Therefore, $x=\boxed{5}$.

